{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2022-05-17 16:15:00', 'title': 'MAA ANNOUNCES 15% INCREASE TO QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'GERMANTOWN, TENN. , MAY 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MAA (NYSE: MAA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.25 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON JULY 29, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JULY 15, 2022.'}